tract stdout from gnubby webauthn plugin failures ([#&#8203;17885](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17885)) ([744e826](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/744e826f79e99a75600193f4794e6eb225871e37))\n- deduplicate x-goog-api-client headers ([#&#8203;17616](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17616)) ([6167e41](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/6167e4136e24a40fa6fc77be5987ba9cab8ac5e8))\n- **oauth2:** avoid redundant JWKS network fetches ([#&#8203;17891](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17891)) ([de53298](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/de53298212cd4da417f22a5c1697901e0621b975))\n\n##### Performance Improvements\n\n- **auth:** use generator expression in any() to allow short-circuiting ([735e565](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/735e5659be9e48776101f3530db441968e587135))\n- **auth:** use generator expression in any() to allow short-circuiting ([#&#8203;17937](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17937)) ([735e565](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/735e5659be9e48776101f3530db441968e587135))\n\n### [`v2.56.2`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.56.2): google-auth: v2.56.2\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.56.1...google-auth-v2.56.2)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** centralize cert discovery logic and steps ([#&#8203;17696](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17696)) ([edc0423](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/edc0423e57dd06bef3a93802642a074ab8b7bc5d))\n- **auth:** exit early when agent cert config is outside well-known directory ([#&#8203;17762](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issue