[7bfa41a](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/7bfa41a6746c43125f3534104aaaa7e8b18758ec))\n- **auth:** align mTLS discovery and enforce fail-fast transport configuration. ([#&#8203;17470](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17470)) ([f492d3d](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/f492d3d5e5a4b693caf7c9a8fbfdfc073a1bcda8))\n- **auth:** handle PermissionError on workload certificates to avoid startup hang and crash ([#&#8203;17568](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17568)) ([f538ad8](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/f538ad830631fa0a855c68b7cfb05788b31f03e3))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"every weekend\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/dcplaya/home-ops).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yNDIuMiIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjIyMi41IiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJ0eXBlL21pbm9yIl19-->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcplaya/home-ops/issues/415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dcplaya/home-ops/issues/415/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/issues/457","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/issues/457/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/issues/457/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/issues/457/events","html_url":"https://github.com/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/pull/457","id":5983247159,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBka-C88AAAABKEV2CA","number":457,"title":"Align the root declare of a byte dst at byte 1 of its channel","user":{"login":"maleadt","id":383068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzA2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/383068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt","html_url":"https://github.com/maleadt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maleadt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-22T16:20:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T18:16:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/pulls/457","html_url":"https://github.com/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/pull/457","diff_url":"https://github.com/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/pull/457.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/pull/457.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #456.\r\n\r\n`HWConformity::fixDstAlignment` accepts a byte destination that starts at byte 1 of its execution channel. It takes that offset from `tryToAlignOperand` but ignores the function's result. When the operand itself can't be aligned, `tryToAlignOperand` returns false before aligning the operand's root declare (`BuildIRImpl.cpp`). The reported offset is then only relative to the declare, which RA may still place anywhere its own (word) alignment allows. If RA puts it at byte 2 of a dword, the byte lands at byte 3. Gen12LP can't write a byte destination there for a dword execution type, so the value is lost.\r\n\r\nThe pattern comes from `localDefHoisting`. It folds a `mov` from a dword into element 1 of a 2-byte variable, `mov (1|M0) r6.11<4>:b r6.4<0;1,0>:d` on TGL. DG2 and MTL generate the same instruction but happened to place it at byte 1.\r\n\r\nThis aligns the root declare to the execution type in that case, using `tryToAlignOperandRootDcl`. Other cases are unchanged.\r\n\r\nThe new ocloc test `optimizations/byte-dst-root-align.cl` (`REQUIRES: regkeys, tgllp-supported`) checks that no byte destination of a dword channel starts at byte 2 or 3. I ran its FileCheck lines against the ocloc output with and without the fix (it fails, then passes), but haven't run the LIT suite.\r\n\r\nI checked the fix by building it into libigc 2.41.5 (JuliaPackaging/Yggdrasil#15280) and testing on a Tiger Lake Iris Xe:\r\n- the reproducer from #456 returns the right value;\r\n- the oneAPI.jl kernels that originally failed return the right values;\r\n- oneAPI.jl's test suite passes.\r\n\r\nAssisted by: Opus 5.5\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/issues/457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intel/intel-graphics-compiler/issues/457/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/issues/1188","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/issues/1188/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/issues/1188/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/issues/1188/events","html_url":"https://github.com/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/pull/1188","id":6313011095,"node_id":"PR_kwDOS7noQs8AAAABOLc7Ww","number":1188,"title":"SIS-2026-0841: integrar NFS-e em homologação ao Financeiro","user":{"login":"EduardoJeiel007","id":293921287,"node_id":"U_kgDOEYTiBw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/293921287?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoJeiel007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoJeiel007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-10T18:15:35Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T18:15:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/pulls/1188","html_url":"https://github.com/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/pull/1188","diff_url":"https://github.com/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/pull/1188.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/pull/1188.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!-- chamado:auto:start -->\n**Chamado:** SIS-2026-0841 — INTEGRAÇÃO DO SITE DE EMISSÃO DE NOTAS FISCAIS DA PREFEITURA COM O SISTEMA ERP\n\n**Descrição:** Verificar a possibilidade de integrar o sistema com o site de emissão de notas fiscais, para podermos emitir as nf diretamente dentro do sistema ERP.\nSite utilizado: https://webapp1-triunfo.cidade360.cloud/nfse.portal/\n<!-- chamado:auto:end -->\n\nPermite solicitar a emissão de NFS-e de homologação a partir da conferência em Financeiro → Emissão de NF → Controle de Notas, acompanhar processamento/rejeição e baixar XML/PDF oficiais da API GOVBR.\n\nA preparação financeira permanece separada do documento de teste. O piloto aceita somente homologação: banco, geração da DPS e cliente HTTP bloqueiam produção. Cancelamento e substituição fiscais não fazem parte desta entrega.\n\n## Implementação\n\n- Fila persistente e numeração transacional por empresa/série; valores da solicitação são obtidos do banco.\n- Certificado A1 por CNPJ no servidor, assinatura e validação XSD nacional 1.01, conexão mTLS e envio assíncrono.\n- Marcador antes do POST, reserva com prazo e reconciliação por protocolo/DPS para impedir retransmissão automática após timeout ou reinício.\n- Recuperação de PDF preservando a autorização/XML já obtidos.\n- Menu `financeiro-nfse`, ações no Gerenciamento de Acesso, RLS e armazenamento privado.\n- Entrada isolada `npm run nfse:homologacao` para homologação assistida, além da integração ao ciclo habitual do worker.\n- CI instala as dependências do worker antes da suíte de testes.\n\nOs XSDs oficiais foram preservados como fornecidos, inclusive seus espaços. Somente o pattern incompatível da série é normalizado em memória; a compatibilidade está documentada no diretório dos esquemas.\n\n## Validação\n\n- 12 testes específicos passaram após atualizar a branch com a main; ESLint dos arquivos novos passou.\n- Suíte geral executada na preparação do piloto: 4.477 testes passaram em 408 arquivos; build aprovado.\n- Portaria e Guardião passaram para o diff final.\n- PostgreSQL 18 descartável: permissões, RLS, valores canônicos, idempotência, lease e concorrência.\n- Homologação externa com o certificado atualizado da HAAG: notas de teste 1 e 3 autorizadas, com XML/PDF e valores conferidos. O segundo cenário comprovou o agrupamento GOVBR de PIS/COFINS/CSLL.\n- No cluster, RPC e leitura da fila foram verificadas em contexto authenticated do usuário Eduardo, dentro de transação revertida ao final. Nenhuma solicitação ficou gravada nesse ensaio.\n\nO typecheck completo ainda apresenta diagnósticos fora da integração, detalhados em `docs/planos/SIS-2026-0841.md`. O cenário operacional J1.G de usuário sem perfis, habilitado apenas pelo toggle do módulo, permanece pendente de conferência pela interface; não foi presumido como validado.\n\n## Banco e implantação\n\n**As migrations abaixo já foram aplicadas e registradas no cluster durante a preparação autorizada da homologação:**\n\n- `20261110104100_sis_2026_0841_nfse_homologacao.sql`\n- `20261110150000_sis_2026_0841_nfse_acoes_painel.sql`\n\nO certificado e a senha ficam fora do Git. Configuração de exemplo e instruções estão em `docs/nfse-implantacao.md`. A instância local está preparada para conferência pelo operador; o frontend no endereço habitual depende de publicação após a revisão/merge. Nenhuma NFS-e de produção foi emitida.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/issues/1188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NascimentoEmpresa/appify-my-nascimento-9b345b64/issues/1188/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/issues/51","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/issues/51/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/issues/51/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/issues/51/events","html_url":"https://github.com/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/pull/51","id":1526325818,"node_id":"PR_kwDOIpSI685HBBRs","number":51,"title":"chore(deps): update dependency google-auth to v2.62.2","user":{"login":"renovate-bot","id":25180681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTgwNjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25180681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/renovate-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":4926885484,"node_id":"LA_kwDOIpSI688AAAABJapObA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/labels/kokoro:force-run","name":"kokoro:force-run","color":"C1FFB2","default":false,"description":"Add this label to force Kokoro to re-run the tests.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2023-01-09T21:08:20Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T18:15:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/pulls/51","html_url":"https://github.com/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/pull/51","diff_url":"https://github.com/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/pull/51.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/googleapis/cndb-client-testing-protos/pull/51.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [google-auth](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/tree/main/packages/google-auth) ([source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python)) | `==2.15.0` → `==2.62.2` | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/pypi/google-auth/2.62.2?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/pypi/google-auth/2.15.0/2.62.2?slim=true) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>googleapis/google-cloud-python (google-auth)</summary>\n\n### [`v2.62.2`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.62.2): google-auth: v2.62.2\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.62.1...google-auth-v2.62.2)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** prevent race conditions during mTLS cert rotation on 401 responses ([#&#8203;18168](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18168)) ([b86536f](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/b86536f91caa7ff2ea5a37b943444111959422c1))\n- **oauth2:** validate Firebase issuer/subject and warn on omitted audience in verify_firebase_token ([#&#8203;18777](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18777)) ([1851b9c](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/1851b9c3a57d7a5bc7c3da6a7ae89ddc0da0c72a))\n\n##### Documentation\n\n- **google-auth:** update requests intersphinx URL ([#&#8203;18978](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18978)) ([2b4575f](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/2b4575f36f1441792e51efb9394b636940ed539d))\n\n### [`v2.62.1`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.62.1): google-auth: v2.62.1\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.62.0...google-auth-v2.62.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** strip -fips suffix from AWS service name in SigV4 signing ([#&#8203;18920](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18920)) ([2e1899e](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/2e1899ed52a8c5adeb05422f48581124b4ab3fbe))\n- **auth:** use an unencrypted key for mTLS certificate rotation ([#&#8203;18709](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18709)) ([8166325](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/81663259c3743c6ab76005a5decb2b3628cfcc79))\n\n### [`v2.62.0`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.62.0): google-auth: v2.62.0\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.61.0...google-auth-v2.62.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- **auth:** enable bound ID tokens by default on Cloud Run ([#&#8203;18635](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18635)) ([8b625c4](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/8b625c4927371992f4569962292299eced040047))\n\n### [`v2.61.0`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.61.0): google-auth: v2.61.0\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.60.0...google-auth-v2.61.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- **auth:** support bound access and ID tokens for GKE ([#&#8203;18594](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18594)) ([9f5fd7b](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/9f5fd7bdf0707a17c363482b094ccd70a4358389))\n\n### [`v2.60.0`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.60.0): google-auth: v2.60.0\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.59.1...google-auth-v2.60.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- **auth:** Support sync credentials in AsyncAuthorizedSession ([#&#8203;18542](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18542)) ([3799568](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/379956865248ebc40e5b851ede520056e65abcac))\n\n### [`v2.59.1`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.59.1): google-auth: v2.59.1\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.59.0...google-auth-v2.59.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** support mTLS in requests.Request for token refresh and impersonation ([#&#8203;18486](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18486)) ([590376d](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/590376df522bf5f89e0d23b956a85db61c4d48d7))\n\n### [`v2.59.0`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.59.0): google-auth: v2.59.0\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.58.1...google-auth-v2.59.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- declare Python3.15 support ([05b0c34](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/05b0c342683b2b0e1b8dccd201ec86ec89612edc))\n\n### [`v2.58.1`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.58.1): google-auth: v2.58.1\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.58.0...google-auth-v2.58.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** allow mTLS retry when credentials raise NotImplementedError on refresh ([#&#8203;18349](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18349)) ([1665e68](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/1665e6867e0c5d7ea8e7857681efc3aae827d9b7))\n\n### [`v2.58.0`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.58.0): google-auth: v2.58.0\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.57.1...google-auth-v2.58.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- \\[aiohttp] Add mTLS reconfiguration logic when certificate mismatch ([906ace7](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/906ace77a2a4cfe57954b3da727232e2fd481c22))\n- **auth:** \\[aiohttp] Add mTLS reconfiguration logic when certificate mismatch for existing credentials & Agent Identity workloads  ([#&#8203;18224](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18224)) ([906ace7](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/906ace77a2a4cfe57954b3da727232e2fd481c22))\n\n### [`v2.57.1`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.57.1): google-auth: v2.57.1\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.57.0...google-auth-v2.57.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** parse hostname for mTLS and PSC endpoint certificate rotation ([#&#8203;18147](https://redirect.github.com/googlea