v2.58.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- \\[aiohttp] Add mTLS reconfiguration logic when certificate mismatch ([906ace7](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/906ace77a2a4cfe57954b3da727232e2fd481c22))\n- **auth:** \\[aiohttp] Add mTLS reconfiguration logic when certificate mismatch for existing credentials & Agent Identity workloads  ([#&#8203;18224](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18224)) ([906ace7](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/906ace77a2a4cfe57954b3da727232e2fd481c22))\n\n### [`v2.57.1`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.57.1): google-auth: v2.57.1\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.57.0...google-auth-v2.57.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** parse hostname for mTLS and PSC endpoint certificate rotation ([#&#8203;18147](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18147)) ([#&#8203;18201](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18201)) ([b18bb4c](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/b18bb4cb749d2dd10d0e2f7d8505460d305e54fc))\n\n### [`v2.57.0`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.57.0): google-auth: v2.57.0\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.56.3...google-auth-v2.57.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n- **auth:** add deprecation warning for grpcio < 1.83.0 (PQC support) ([#&#8203;18070](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18070)) ([68bdaba](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/68bdaba04c706706bf614587adbda0774d15d81d))\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** parse hostname for mTLS and PSC endpoint certificate rotat… ([#&#8203;18153](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18153)) ([b642373](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/b6423734a2470acd01a7081a4133e4373206f325))\n- **auth:** prevent TypeError and support home-dir cert fallback for X… ([#&#8203;18016](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/18016)) ([b9a1379](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/b9a1379fd673a1cf3b8c1676400ed9789e12de6a))\n\n##### Documentation\n\n- **handwritten:** centralize CONTRIBUTING.rst pointers ([#&#8203;17642](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17642)) ([23b9499](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/23b94994bd5251493b81d91657d1f79a5d3c4b97))\n\n### [`v2.56.3`](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/releases/tag/google-auth-v2.56.3): google-auth: v2.56.3\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/compare/google-auth-v2.56.2...google-auth-v2.56.3)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- **auth:** avoid creating mTLS SSL context for custom async transports ([#&#8203;17825](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17825)) ([fbe33f9](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/fbe33f9653d61353c0263ac2d0bff71eb76131f8)), refs [#&#8203;17622](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17622)\n- **auth:** only trigger mTLS certificate rotation on mTLS endpoints ([#&#8203;17928](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17928)) ([f7b49ea](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/f7b49ea967d93a969c73389c7b7baddf595d9a48))\n- **auth:** properly extract stdout from gnubby webauthn plugin failures ([#&#8203;17885](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/issues/17885)) ([744e826](https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-python/commit/744e826f79e99a75600193f4794e6eb225871e37))\n- deduplicate x-goog-api-client headers ([#&#8203;17616](https://redirect.github.com/googlea